Description: TelcoChisel Base System & Security Tuning Metapackage
 Core operating system low-latency kernel tuning, real-time PAM limits,
 SCTP signaling stack, network monitoring tools, and terminal productivity
 suite for telecom security research.

Package: telcochisel-hardware-sdr
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 udev,
 libuhd-dev | uhd-host,
 hackrf | libhackrf0,
 bladerf | libbladerf2,
 limesuite | liblimesuite23.11-1,
 rtl-sdr | librtlsdr0,
 soapysdr-tools | libsoapysdr0.8,
 libiio-utils | libiio0
Recommends: telcochisel-base
Description: TelcoChisel SDR Hardware Drivers & udev Rules Metapackage
 Hardware device drivers, FPGA bitstream auto-loaders, and non-root udev rules
 for Ettus USRP, HackRF One, BladeRF 2.0 micro, LimeSDR, RTL-SDR v3/v4, and
 ADALM-Pluto Software-Defined Radios.

Package: telcochisel-tools-sdr
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 telcochisel-hardware-sdr,
 gnuradio,
 gqrx-sdr | gqrx,
 inspectrum,
 gpredict,
 soapysdr-module-all | soapysdr-tools
Suggests: urh
Description: TelcoChisel Radio Frequency & DSP Analysis Metapackage
 Comprehensive Software-Defined Radio analysis, digital signal processing,
 satellite Doppler tracking, and spectrum visualization suite.

Package: telcochisel-tools-2g-3g
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 telcochisel-hardware-sdr,
 telcosec-cli,
 build-essential,
 cmake,
 git
Recommends: telcochisel-tools-sdr
Description: TelcoChisel 2G & 3G Cellular Auditing Metapackage
 Prepares a 2G/3G (GSM/GPRS/EDGE/UMTS) auditing environment: SDR hardware
 access, build tooling, and the telcosec-cli helper. The base-station stacks
 (Osmocom, OpenBTS, YateBTS) and frequency scanners are compiled on first run
 via their setup helpers — e.g. "sudo yatebts-install", "sudo openbts-install"
 — because they are not available as Ubuntu packages.

Package: telcochisel-tools-4g
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 telcochisel-hardware-sdr,
 telcosec-cli,
 wireshark,
 build-essential,
 cmake,
 git
Recommends: telcochisel-tools-sdr
Description: TelcoChisel 4G LTE RAN & EPC Auditing Metapackage
 Prepares a 4G LTE RAN/EPC auditing environment: SDR hardware access, Wireshark,
 build tooling, and the telcosec-cli helper. srsRAN 4G/srsUE, LTESniffer,
 LTE-CellScanner and the EPC stack are compiled on first run via their setup
 helpers ("sudo srsran-install", "sudo ltesniffer-install", ...) — they are not
 available as Ubuntu packages.

Package: telcochisel-tools-5g
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 telcochisel-hardware-sdr,
 telcosec-cli,
 wireshark,
 python3-yaml,
 python3-scapy,
 build-essential,
 cmake,
 git
Recommends: telcochisel-tools-4g
Description: TelcoChisel 5G Standalone Core & RAN Metapackage
 Prepares a 5G SA core & RAN environment: SDR hardware access, Wireshark, the
 Python RAN tooling, build tooling, and the telcosec-cli helper. Open5GS (5G SA
 core), UERANSIM (gNB/UE), and the 5Ghoul fuzzer are compiled/installed on first
 run via their setup helpers ("sudo open5gs-install", "sudo 5ghoul-install", ...)
 — they are not available as Ubuntu packages.

Package: telcochisel-tools-sim
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 telcosec-cli,
 pcscd,
 pcsc-tools,
 opensc,
 python3-pyscard,
 python3-pycryptodome,
 python3-pip,
 git
Description: TelcoChisel SIM & Smartcard Security Metapackage
 SIM/USIM/ISIM/eSIM auditing foundation: the PC/SC daemon and tools, OpenSC,
 and the pyscard/pycryptodome Python stack for APDU work. The TelcoSec-specific
 utilities — pySim-shell, Osmocom SIMtrace 2, lpac eSIM assistant, SIMurai and
 SIMtester — are installed on first run via their setup helpers (Python/Git
 projects, not Ubuntu packages).

Package: telcochisel-tools-pstn-adsl
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 mausezahn,
 yersinia,
 ettercap-text-only | ettercap-graphical,
 sipsak | sipp
Description: TelcoChisel Wireline, VoIP & Broadband Security Metapackage
 PSTN, ADSL, VoIP/SIP security testing, QinQ VLAN hopping, packet crafting,
 and DOCSIS broadband network assessment tools.

Package: telcochisel-tools-ue
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 telcosec-cli,
 adb,
 fastboot,
 python3-serial,
 python3-pip,
 git
Description: TelcoChisel User Equipment & Baseband Research Metapackage
 Prepares a UE/baseband research environment: ADB/Fastboot device access, serial
 tooling, and the telcosec-cli helper. The analysis suites — QCSuper and SCAT
 (DIAG trace logging), FirmWire (baseband fuzzing), MTKClient and EDL (flashing)
 — are Python/Git projects installed on first run via their setup helpers, not
 Ubuntu packages.

